{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/runConcurrently(_:)"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Concurrency.swift#L264","fileName":"Concurrency.swift"},"title":"runConcurrently(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"runConcurrently","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConcurrentChange","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule16ConcurrentChangeV"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"extendedModule":"WorldModule","externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V15runConcurrentlyyySayAA16ConcurrentChangeVGF","role":"symbol"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/runconcurrently(_:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"runConcurrently"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"changes"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConcurrentChange","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ConcurrentChange","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule16ConcurrentChangeV"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"changes","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The changes to run.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this method to spread independent work across the processor’s cores. Each change reads","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the world as it was before any of them ran, and writes only the types its access lists, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the result is the same as running the changes one after another in any order:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var world = World()","let ball = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), Health(current: 10))","","world.runConcurrently([","    ConcurrentChange(access: .reads(Velocity.self).writes(Position.self)) { world in","        world.update(Position.self, reading: Velocity.self) { position, row in","            position.x += row.components.dx","        }","    },","    ConcurrentChange(access: .writes(Health.self)) { world in","        world.update(Health.self) { health, _ in health.current -= 1 }","    },","])","","print(world[Position.self, of: ball].x, world[Health.self, of: ball].current)","\/\/ Prints \"1.0 9\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A change sees the components and resources that other changes write as missing, so its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"access must list everything it reads. Command buffers a change queues with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/queue(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are queued in this world in the order of ","type":"text"},{"code":"changes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"important","name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A change must write only the component and resource types its access lists,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and must not spawn or despawn entities. It writes relations through their "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components, and the hierarchy through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Targets<ChildOf>"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"style":"note","name":"Complexity","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"c"}]},{"type":"text","text":"·"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}]},{"type":"text","text":"), besides the cost of the changes themselves, where "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"c"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"number of changes and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is the number of component types the world has stored."}]}]},{"style":"note","name":"Precondition","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No two accesses conflict, and each change writes only what its access"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lists and spawns and despawns nothing; a change that breaks this traps. In debug builds,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a change that reads a component or resource type its access doesn’t list traps too. Any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change may read "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Prefab","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Runs changes at the same time, each on its own copy of the world, and keeps what each one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wrote.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule","title":"WorldModule","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Store the state of a game or simulation as entities and components, and read and change it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queries, updates, and commands."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/applyQueuedCommands()":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/applyqueuedcommands()","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/applyQueuedCommands()","title":"applyQueuedCommands()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"applyQueuedCommands"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Applies every queued command buffer, in the order the buffers were queued, and empties the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queue."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Targets":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/targets","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","title":"Targets","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Targets"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Targets"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The component that holds a source entity’s targets of a relation, with the relation’s value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for each.","type":"text"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/runConcurrently(_:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/runconcurrently(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/runConcurrently(_:)","title":"runConcurrently(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"runConcurrently","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConcurrentChange","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule16ConcurrentChangeV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Runs changes at the same time, each on its own copy of the world, and keeps what each one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wrote.","type":"text"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/queue(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/queue(_:)","title":"queue(_:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds a command buffer to the world’s queue, to apply later with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/applyQueuedCommands()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"queue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Commands","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule8CommandsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/queue(_:)"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Disabled":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A component that makes queries and updates skip an entity, unless they ask for it."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Disabled","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Disabled","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Disabled","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/disabled"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World":{"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","title":"World","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"World","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A collection of entities, the components they hold, and resources."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"World","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Prefab":{"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/prefab","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Prefab","title":"Prefab","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Prefab"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A component that marks an entity as a template for spawning copies."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Prefab"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/ConcurrentChange":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A change to a world, paired with the access that describes what it reads and writes."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ConcurrentChange","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConcurrentChange","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ConcurrentChange","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/concurrentchange","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ConcurrentChange","kind":"identifier"}]}}}